@Demogorgon314 

> Should we make it sequentially?

It will be sequentially because multi tasks will use the same `connection`, and then they will be executed one by one. Only send `GET_TOPICS_OF_NAMESPACE` concurrently, so it is thread safety, and will run more than more times

